470
00:27:33.617 --> 00:27:34.783
Pleasure.

471
00:27:34.851 --> 00:27:36.384
Don't you steal her.

472
00:27:36.452 --> 00:27:37.620
Hi.

473
00:27:37.687 --> 00:27:40.188
Nice to meet you.
Congratulations.

474
00:27:40.256 --> 00:27:41.790
