You are so cynical.
- Rachel. enough.

703
00:41:53.442 --> 00:41:55.076
Rachel. she is making
an effort here.

704
00:41:55.144 --> 00:41:57.379
Oh! An effort. is that what that was?
Because I think she presumes

705
