712
00:42:09.625 --> 00:42:11.459
Oh. my God.

713
00:42:11.494 --> 00:42:15.497
Kymmie. your sister has got
a lot on her plate right now.

714
00:42:15.564 --> 00:42:18.333
She is uptight about...
