779
00:44:57.275 --> 00:44:58.676
Rehabilitation. crisis.

780
00:44:58.744 --> 00:45:00.495
You should really
learn the difference.

781
00:45:00.562 --> 00:45:01.596
No. it's like
you're not happy

782
00:45:01.664 --> 00:45:03.380
