799
00:45:59.004 --> 00:46:01.239
I can barely
believe this myself!

800
00:46:01.307 --> 00:46:03.408
How far? How along?
You know?

801
00:46:03.476 --> 00:46:05.276
I mean.
how pregnant are you?

802
00:46:05.344 --> 00:46:07.495
Did you tell
your mother?

803
