a lot of acknowledgment.

871
00:49:22.724 --> 00:49:24.475
You think?

872
00:49:24.543 --> 00:49:25.927
Come on.

873
00:49:25.994 --> 00:49:27.361
It can't be easy.

874
00:49:27.429 --> 00:49:29.947
Everybody knowing
